{"reviewId": "323959890_87biSbc6C", "review": {"abstract": "未来5年是资产的下降期，这个时候尽量持有流动性好的资产，而不要持有流动性差的资产", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterUid": 23, "content": "这是绝对没问题的，可能有些人觉得预测的稍微有偏差早了几年，但是对于持有大量资产的人，尤其是大公司，当看到下行时再掉头就晚了，真正能脱身的但是在反弹期提前掉头的。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "6312-6352", "createTime": 1772014241, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 23, "reviewId": "323959890_87biSbc6C", "userVid": 323959890, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "author": {"userVid": 323959890, "name": "默", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/2pm5Nb2cMaOyhO7Prfpdf1rLPhSztXT2rWViaOqCtla14BbETrDOJ9DxgGnnnV60y628KJVgPOEA/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 74189810, "name": "阿白", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ajNVdqHZLLCM85I45icAOZICrZ3ciaQuHJtvGwtSCkG98s0k2dicBcCbDATbiaLMsBG3O8O2Stoib0aYc9LNMpQqERw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "阿白", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "尾大不掉", "reviewId": "